WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Conversations”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose the conversation
Open Conversations and pick the channel or search for the customer you need.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Review and reply
Read the message history and the customer's details, then write your reply and send it through the available channel.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Organize the follow-up
Use assignment, status and tags according to your permissions, and check that the changes were saved.
